Put here shell rc files, they are sourced by Bash and Zsh:

1. Both shells source `*.sh` files in this directory (rc.d) in alphabetical order.
2. Each shell sources `*.bash`/`*.zsh` files inside a corresponding rc.d subfolder.

- Non-interactive shells only source files `0*` and `9*` (01-environment.sh, etc.)
- Interactive shells source all files

It is highly recommended to name user files with a number prefix to control order.
The recommended index is anything between 10 and 89.